Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:09:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] test-posix: Check <setjmp.h>, and what setjmp and
 sigsetjmp keep and restore

Values passed through, objects, callee-saved registers (with assembly
that clobbers them on aarch64 and arm), the floating-point environment,
and the signal mask: saved or not, from signal handlers, on the
alternate stack and per thread.
